## What's next

Chapter 7 keeps the loop but sharpens the state. A body is a plain value; a *world* is a list of them. Chapter 7 shows how to model many kinds of entity as plain values, update them functionally, and query them with the list operations you learned in Chapter 2 — no special entity system required, just data and the SRFI-1 toolbox.
")
